cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite it as below, and cite Lavi's preprint for the mathematics."
type: software
title: "Lean 4 formalization of Section 2 of Lavi's proof of Foregger's conjecture"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Maciejewski
    given-names: Tom
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-5702-5302"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - permanent
  - doubly stochastic matrix
  - nearly decomposable matrix
  - Foregger's conjecture
abstract: >-
  A sorry-free Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of Section 2 (Lemmas 2.1-2.5)
  and of the cycle-support case of Y. Lavi's 2026 preprint on Foregger's
  conjecture on minimum permanents of nearly decomposable doubly stochastic
  matrices. The main theorems depend only on Lean's standard axioms. Sections
  3-7 of the preprint are not formalized, so this is not a machine-checked
  proof of Foregger's conjecture.
references:
